  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🚀 Performance Architecture Hardening\n\n      - Removed internal handler map infrastructure.\n      - Removed handler contribution / registry system.\n      - Dispatcher now resolves handlers directly via closed generic DI registrations.\n      - Simplified internal architecture by eliminating handler map state and lookup indirection.\n      - Reduced hot-path overhead during command dispatch.\n      - Improved maintainability and reduced moving parts in multi-assembly scenarios.\n\n      ⚠️ Internal breaking change:\n      Handler resolution now relies entirely on DI registrations generated by TinyDispatcher.SourceGen.\n      Custom or manual handler map integrations are no longer supported.\n\n      This change is part of ongoing v1 performance hardening.",
